<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (1. The price forms a certain range and levels of support and resistance, and we mark them on the hourly timeframe. 2. Then the price very quickly approaches the level of resistance, as in this case, it breaks this level, the stop losses of participants who had shorts \(deals on the decrease\) are triggered and the price reverses.)
/E (1. The price forms a certain range and levels of support and resistance, and we mark them on the hourly timeframe. 2. Then the price very quickly approaches the level of resistance, as in this case, it breaks this level, the stop losses of participants who had shorts \(deals on the decrease\) are triggered and the price reverses.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [3]
>>
