227 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H4
/T (1. Wait until the price impulsively approaches the level, breaks it and starts to fall below the level, the volume should be 3-5 times higher than the average at the breakout. 2. Place a stop loss above the top of the false breakout. 3. Take profit is set at a risk-to-profit ratio of 1 to 3.)
/E (1. Wait until the price impulsively approaches the level, breaks it and starts to fall below the level, the volume should be 3-5 times higher than the average at the breakout. 2. Place a stop loss above the top of the false breakout. 3. Take profit is set at a risk-to-profit ratio of 1 to 3.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [6]
>>
