/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (1. Mark the price levels of support and resistance when the price has formed a range. 2. Wait for the price to quickly and impulsively approach one of the levels. 3. Make sure that a large vertical volume appears when the level is broken. 4. When the price starts to fall below the level, we enter the trade, placing a Stop Loss at the top of the false breakout \(the so-called tail of the false breakout\). Take Profit is set at 1 to 3.)
/E (1. Mark the price levels of support and resistance when the price has formed a range. 2. Wait for the price to quickly and impulsively approach one of the levels. 3. Make sure that a large vertical volume appears when the level is broken. 4. When the price starts to fall below the level, we enter the trade, placing a Stop Loss at the top of the false breakout \(the so-called tail of the false breakout\). Take Profit is set at 1 to 3.)
