/E (1. Wait until the price smoothly approaches the level or the upper boundary of the range, and starts to stand there for a certain time, i.e., the accumulation before the level will continue, and after the level is broken, enter the trade. 2. Set a stop loss below the last price pullback that occurred. 3. Take profit is set in the ratio of risk to profit of 1 to 3.)
